,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082004707,"data":" Create a short, concise summary of the paper based on its abstract.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082056675,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082061939,"data":"Few-shot learning (FSL) is one of the key future steps in machine learning and raises a lot of attention. In this paper, we focus on the FSL problem of dialogue understanding, which contains two closely related tasks: intent detect \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082067238,"data":"---\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082076467,"data":" The paper presents a new FSL benchmark called FewJoint, which includes 59 different dialogue domains from real industrial APIs. The paper also introduces a few-shot learning technique called FewJoint to address the challenge of joint learning in the few-shot scenario. The paper finds that insufficient performance in the few-shot setting can lead to noisy sharing between two sub-tasks, and proposes a novel trust gating mechanism to ensure high-quality sharing. The paper also introduces a Reptile-based meta-learning strategy to improve generalization in unseen few-shot domains. Overall, the paper advances the research of FSL by providing a new corpus and proposing several techniques to overcome the challenges of joint learning in the few-shot scenario. \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082084567,"data":"[finished: True ]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082089067,"data":"================================================================================ \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082093228,"data":" Is there a meaning for Christmas wreaths? \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082097331,"data":"---\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082101733,"data":" Yes, there is a meaning behind the Christmas wreath. It represents the idea of renewal and rebirth, as well as the hope that things will be better in the future. The wreath can also symbolize the arrival of Christ and his message of love and compassion. Additionally, it can represent the idea of unity and community, as many people gather together to celebrate this holiday season. Overall, the Christmas wreath holds significant cultural and spiritual significance in many communities around the world. \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082122856,"data":"[finished: True ]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082127032,"data":"================================================================================ \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082131145,"data":" What are some species of bears that are now extinct? \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082134832,"data":"---\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082138454,"data":" There are several species of bears that have become extinct, including:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082142775,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082149748,"data":"1. Black Bear (Ursus americanus)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082154094,"data":"2. Polar Bear (Ursus maritimus)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082157851,"data":"3. Grizzly Bear (Ursus horribilis)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082161492,"data":"4. Mountain Gorilla (Gorilla beringei)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.08216539,"data":"5. Sumatran Elephant (Elephas maximus sumatrae)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082169138,"data":"6. Bornean Orangutan (Panulid apes)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6059.082172967,"data":"7. Philippine Eagle (Peregrine falcon) \n"}
